== (a) record tag, real bsc output
$ bsc P59 SumTotals [{ Kind = :'P59.Order', Id = 1, Total = 5 }]
5
  -> exit 0
$ bsc P59 SumTotals [{ Kind = :'Other.Thing', Id = 1, Total = 5 }]
crashed: error:function_clause
  -> exit 1
$ bsc P59 TotalOf { Kind = :'Other.Thing', Id = 1, Total = 5 }
crashed: error:function_clause
  -> exit 1
== (a') counterfactual: Total/1's guard stripped from bsc's own .abstr
stripped SumTotals(forged) = 5
== (b) int kind
$ bsc P59 SumBig [3, 100]
1
  -> exit 0
$ bsc P59 SumBig [100.5]
1
  -> exit 0
$ bsc P59 SumBig [300]
1
  -> exit 0
$ bsc P59 BigOf 100.5
crashed: error:function_clause
  -> exit 1
$ bsc P59 BigOf 300
crashed: error:function_clause
  -> exit 1
